{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54158","headline":"因道吾指夹山寻师颂 · 择禅师","name":"因道吾指夹山寻师颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京口谈玄已有名，吾山特地涉途程。\n虽云法眼无瑕翳，争奈真人掩耳听。\n参学须参真心匠。\n合头须诈不劳聆。\n此来更欲寻师去，决至应当暂改形。\n道友当年深契会，老僧今日苦叮咛。\n特报水云知识道，半秋孤月落花亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"择禅师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54158.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54158","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}